{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"4f50543f99f7225fcd6ddfe629f589e05c0655922cd97b07218d4e006aaad07c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["智慧人的作为"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"当将你的粮食撒在水面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为日久必能得着。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要分给七人，或分给八人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你不知道将来有什么灾祸临到地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"云若满了雨，就必倾倒在地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树若向南倒，或向北倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树倒在何处，就存在何处。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看风的，必不撒种；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"望云的，必不收割。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["风从何道来，骨头在怀孕妇人的胎中如何长成，你尚且不得知道；这样，行万事之 神的作为，你更不得知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["早晨要撒你的种，晚上也不要歇你的手，因为你不知道哪一样发旺；或是早撒的，或是晚撒的，或是两样都好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["光本是佳美的，眼见日光也是可悦的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人活多年，就当快乐多年；然而也当想到黑暗的日子。因为这日子必多，所要来的都是虚空。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["对年轻人的忠告"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["少年人哪，你在幼年时当快乐。在幼年的日子，使你的心欢畅，行你心所愿行的，看你眼所爱看的；却要知道，为这一切的事， 神必审问你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以，你当从心中除掉愁烦，从肉体克去邪恶；因为一生的开端和幼年之时，都是虚空的。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}